/// A thing a row may hand out.
///
/// The set exists to be named: a column typed `foreign Reward` reaches every catalogue that
/// declares `extends=Reward`, and a new catalogue joins by writing that on its own sheet
/// rather than by being added to every column that names the list.
/// spec/polymorphism.md section 3.
abstract struct Reward
    /// Shown to the player. Every catalogue in the set carries one.
    field name string
    /// The art beside the name.
    field icon string
